  aboutMes:
  - ' - I work as a barista\n - My dream is to be a writer\n - My love language is
    words of affirmation'
  - ' - Dazzling singer and songwriter\n - Animal shelter volunteer\n - Looking for
    a fun-filled serious relationship'
  - ' - Philosopher mindset\n - Love language is compliments with quotes\n - Looking
    for a serious relationship'
  - ' - Part time lifeguard, part time athlete\n - Love language is acts of service\n
    - Favorite summer drink is Pina Colada'
  - ' - I work as a hairstylist\n - My love language is acts of service\n - Looking
    for a serious relationship'
  - ' - Occupation: Game developer at a small studio\n - I love R&B music, but I
    don''t really like metal\n - Love language: Quality time'
  - ONLY SWIPE RIGHT IF YOU'RE UNDER 25!!!!!!!\n - Streamer on Pitch (@sniperextraordinaire)\n
    - Top 100 LoM player\n - My love language is physical touch\n - My favorite meal
    is chicken wings and beer.
  - ' - Committed to the gym\n - Love language: Words of affirmation\n - Looking
    for my looksmatch'
  - ' - I own a Porsche\n - My love language is physical touch\n - Looking for a
    serious relationship with someone young and full of energy'
  - ' - I don''t trust people easily\n - My love language is acts of service\n -
    I''m not looking for anything serious\n - Let''s see who can down a shot of whiskey
    faster, shall we?'
  - ' - Working as a surgeon\n - Looking for someone to spice up my boring life\n
    - I''m an indoors person\n - My love language is quality time'
  - ' - Entrepreneur in San Fransokyo\n - Extroverted and outdoorsy\n - I get jealous
    easily\n - Love language: Physical touch'
  - ' - Love language: Words of affirmation\n - Occupation: Nurse\n - Favorite Drink:
    Coffee'
  - 'I''m only looking for one special girl. '
  - ' - Human male working as a fireman\n - I like pizza\n - Love Language: Words
    of affirmation'
  - ' - I like hiking, just for the scenery\n - My love language is physical touch\n
    - I work as a park ranger and tour guide'
  - ' - Professional chef\n - Love language: Acts of service - especially cooking!\n
    - I go to the gym in my free time '
  - ' - Popular fitness influencer with 100k+ followers\n - My favorite superhero
    is the Hulk (guess my favorite color)\n - My love language is quality time'
